      }
    },
    "Draws pairs like != and => as one glyph, in fonts that have the shapes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在具备相应字形的字体中，把 !=、=> 这样的字符对绘制为一个字形。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each host lists its projects of the space, the latest used first; those not used for 30 days are under Older, and the tabs with no project come last, in every space.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每台主机列出当前空间的项目，最近用过的在前；30 天没用的放在「更早」下。无项目的标签页列在最后，每个空间都显示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each step is one point with a light tap, and the grid's columns and rows show for a moment. The size stays for every terminal.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每一级 1 pt，伴随轻微震动，并短暂显示行列数。字号对所有终端生效并保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ed25519 keys are fast, compact, and supported by all modern OpenSSH servers.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ed25519 密钥速度快、体积小，所有现代 OpenSSH 服务器均支持。"
