      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以自己的颜色打开"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Option": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Option"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Option is Alt, chords with Control, Shift or Option reach the program, and held keys repeat.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Option 作为 Alt，Control、Shift、Option 组合键都能传给程序，按住的键会连发。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Orange": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "橙色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pair automatically via Tailscale, or enter your Rex server details manually.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通过 Tailscale 自动配对，或手动输入 Rex 服务器信息。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pair by QR code": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "扫码配对"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pair via QR Code": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "扫码配对"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pair with %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "与 %@ 配对"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pair with GoRex": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "与 GoRex 配对"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paired by GoRex's Rex Go code. Deleting the host here doesn't revoke this phone: remove it from Devices in GoRex's Settings › Server.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通过 GoRex 的 Rex Go 二维码配对。在这里删除主机不会撤销本机的授权：请在 GoRex 的 设置 › 服务器 › 设备 中移除它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paired. Rex Go is connected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已配对，Rex Go 已连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Passphrase (optional)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "密码短语（可选）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Passphrase (required)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "密码短语（必填）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Password": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "密码"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paste": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "粘贴"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paste an OpenSSH or PEM private key (Ed25519, RSA, or ECDSA).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "粘贴 OpenSSH 或 PEM 格式的私钥（支持 Ed25519、RSA 或 ECDSA）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paste from the ⌘ menu on the key bar, from the selection's menu, or with ⌘V.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可从按键栏的 ⌘ 菜单、选区菜单粘贴，或按 ⌘V。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paste or select a private key.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请粘贴或选择一个私钥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pasted paths are quoted for the shell and end with a space. A name the shell cannot take is not pasted, and an alert says why.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "粘贴的路径已按 shell 规则加引号，并以空格结尾。shell 无法接受的文件名不会粘贴，并会提示原因。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Path": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "路径"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paths ready for the shell": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "直接可用的路径"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Peer Relay": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "节点中继"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Permission denied": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有访问权限"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Photo": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "照片"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Photos go to the host's temporary folder as their original files, and their paths are pasted into the terminal.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "照片以原始文件上传到主机的临时文件夹，并把路径粘贴到终端。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
