      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "私钥"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Private Key File": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "私钥文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Private keys stay in this device's Keychain and are never synced to iCloud. Default keys are offered in order when an SSH host is set to Automatic.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "私钥仅保存在本机钥匙串中，不会同步到 iCloud。当 SSH 主机设为「自动」时，将按顺序尝试默认密钥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Problem Report": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "问题报告"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Programs copy to the clipboard": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "程序可复制到剪贴板"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Programs such as Neovim and tmux copy to the clipboard with OSC 52, from the terminal on screen only. They cannot read it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Neovim、tmux 等程序可用 OSC 52 复制到剪贴板，仅限屏幕上的终端。程序无法读取剪贴板。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
