    "Settings › Terminal's Composer Mode pins a message bar over the key bar and moves the mic into it: typing and dictation fill the message, photos and files attach, and Send puts it all into the terminal as one prompt.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Settings › Terminal's Composer Mode pins a message bar over the key bar and moves the mic into it: typing and dictation fill the message, photos and files attach, and Send puts it all into the terminal as one prompt."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「设置 › 终端」的 Composer 模式把消息栏固定在键栏上方，并把麦克风移入其中：输入与听写进入消息字段，可附照片和文件，发送时全部作为一条提示进入终端。"
