          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap Control, Option or Shift, then a key, for a chord. They let go after that key.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先点 Control、Option 或 Shift，再按一个键即可组合。按完后修饰键自动松开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap a link to open it": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "轻点打开链接"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap a machine to test the connection to it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "轻点一台电脑，测试与它的连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap the mic on the key bar, or at the top right of the terminal on iPad or with a hardware keyboard, and speak; tap it again, and what you said is typed at the cursor, not sent. Speech is recognised on this device by SenseVoice, in Chinese, English, Cantonese, Japanese or Korean, with punctuation. Its model, about 240 MB, downloads on the first tap; choose a larger one, or delete it, in Settings › Terminal.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "轻点按键栏上的麦克风（在 iPad 上或连接硬件键盘时，在终端右上角）并说话；再点一下，你说的话就打在光标处，但不发送。语音由 SenseVoice 在本机上识别，支持中文、英语、粤语、日语和韩语，带标点。它的模型约 240 MB，首次轻点时下载；可在“设置 › 终端”中换用更大的模型，或删除它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap to click": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "轻点即点击"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap to open the terminal": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "轻点通知打开终端"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap to speak, and again to type what you said.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "轻点开始说话，再点一下把你说的话打进终端。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap to stop.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "轻点停止。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Teal": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "青色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Terminal": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "终端"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The %@ key of %@@%@:%@ is\n\n%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%2$@@%3$@:%4$@ 的 %1$@ 密钥指纹为\n\n%5$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The + by a host browses its folders and makes a project of one. New Tab in a project opens on its host, in its folder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主机旁的 + 浏览它的文件夹，用其中一个新建项目。项目里的新标签页在它的主机上、它的文件夹中打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The codes match": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "代码一致"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The command new terminals on a host run in place of its login shell.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该主机上新终端运行的命令，用来代替登录 shell。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The connection was lost.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连接已断开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The eye lists the tabs of every host by what their programs need: waiting for input first, then failed, done and working, with how long ago.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "眼睛图标按程序的状态列出所有主机的标签页：等待输入的在前，然后是失败、完成和运行中，并显示距今多久。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The host does not send files": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此主机不支持发送文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The images leave this gallery. Files on the computer stay.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "图片会从这个相册移除，电脑上的文件保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The interface follows the system, or stays dark or light.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "界面可跟随系统，也可固定为深色或浅色。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The key bar's keys and four repeating arrows go in the keyboard's shortcuts bar, which shows with a hardware keyboard too and gives a Magic Keyboard its Esc.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按键栏的按键和四个可连发的方向键放在键盘的快捷键栏里，接外接键盘时也会显示，让妙控键盘也有 Esc。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The keyboard slides the terminal": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "键盘推起终端"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The licenses of the code, fonts and themes the app ships, and its source on GitHub.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App 自带的代码、字体和主题的许可，以及 GitHub 上的源代码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The link you tapped names a file on %@ that its text may not show:": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你点的链接指向 %@ 上的这个文件，链接文字未必显示它："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The list beside the terminal": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "列表与终端并排"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The list, the buttons, the sheets and the key bar use the system's Liquid Glass.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "列表、按钮、弹出面板和按键栏都采用系统的液态玻璃。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The machine may have let in an unknown device: remove its newest device in its Settings › Server › Devices.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "那台电脑可能放进了一台未知设备：请在它的 设置 › 服务器 › 设备 中移除最新的设备。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The mic types what you say into the terminal, without pressing Return; the model you choose recognises it on this device. Fun-ASR-Nano and Qwen3-ASR are larger and slower: on a Mac they take 2 to 2.6 GB of memory, and phones with less may not run them. Swipe a model to delete it. With an API key, the text you dictate and words from the terminal screen go to the service you set here, which corrects misheard terms and punctuation. Without a key, nothing you dictate leaves the device. The key and these settings sync through iCloud to your other devices.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "麦克风把你说的话打进终端，但不按回车；语音由你选的模型在本机上识别。Fun-ASR-Nano 和 Qwen3-ASR 更大、更慢：在 Mac 上要占 2 到 2.6 GB 内存，内存更小的手机可能跑不动。左滑模型可删除它。填了 API 密钥后，你听写的文字和终端屏幕上的单词会发到你在这里设置的服务，由它纠正听错的术语和标点。没有密钥时，你听写的内容不会离开本机。密钥和这些设置会通过 iCloud 同步到你的其他设备。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The name shows on this device only.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个名称只在本设备上显示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The new name applies at the next start: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "新名称将在下次启动时生效：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The pairing didn't match.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "配对不一致。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The photo picker opens at half the screen, with the terminal above it. Pull it up for the full screen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "照片选择器以半屏打开，上方仍能看到终端。向上拉即可全屏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The picker at the top shows one space at a time, such as Work or Life. Tap it to see every space with its projects: New Space adds one, and Edit renames, colors and orders them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "顶部的选择器一次显示一个空间，例如「工作」或「生活」。点按它可查看每个空间及其项目：「新建空间」添加空间，「编辑」重命名空间、设颜色和排序。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The port of an ssh:// address is a number from 1 to 65535.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ssh:// 地址的端口须为 1 到 65535 之间的数字。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The program exited with code %lld.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "程序已退出，退出码 %lld。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The project's tabs open on %@, in this folder. A folder is one project: if it is one already, that project shows.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "项目的标签页在 %@ 上的这个文件夹中打开。一个文件夹只对应一个项目：它已是项目时，显示那个项目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The search at the bottom filters the tabs by title, in the list and in Needs You.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "底部的搜索框可按标题筛选标签页，在主列表和「待我处理」中均可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The search at the bottom filters the tabs by title, in the list and under the eye.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "底部的搜索按标题筛选标签页，列表和动态视图都适用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The search at the bottom of Settings filters its rows.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设置底部的搜索可筛选设置项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server refused the terminal.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务器拒绝了这个终端。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server refused this device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务器拒绝了此设备。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The space stays here, empty, until a project moves into it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个空间会留在这里，保持为空，直到有项目移入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The tab closed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "标签页已关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The terminal does not resize as the keyboard comes and goes. It slides up only as far as the cursor and the lines under it need.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "键盘弹出或收起时终端不改变尺寸，只上移到刚好露出光标及其下方的行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The terminal's background fills the screen. Text under the status bar blurs and fades, so the clock stays legible.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "终端背景铺满整个屏幕。状态栏下的文字会模糊淡出，时间依然清晰可读。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The terminal's snapshot could not be read.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法读取终端快照。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The title opens the session": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "轻点标题打开会话"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The title shows the tab's program and title. Tap it for the session's tabs, New Tab and Switch Session.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "标题显示标签页的程序和标题。轻点可查看会话的标签页、新建标签页和切换会话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The tray button at the bottom shows how many tabs wait for you and opens Needs You: waiting for input, failed and done first, with working tasks below.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "底部收件箱按钮会显示待处理数量，点开进入「待我处理」：需要输入、失败和已完成优先置顶，进行中的任务显示在下方。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The version, the device, iOS and each host's Rex version. Settings › Developer copies version or debug info for a problem report.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显示版本、设备、iOS 版本和每台主机的 Rex 版本。在「设置 › 开发者」里可复制版本或调试信息用于问题报告。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Themes": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主题"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Themes with a preview": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "带预览的主题"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They differ": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "代码不同"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Third-Party Notices": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "第三方声明"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Device": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本设备"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This device has no microphone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此设备没有麦克风。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This folder is not there.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个文件夹不存在。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This phone's key for GoRex's remote access: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本机用于 GoRex 远程访问的密钥：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Three glass capsules: ⌘, a row of keys, and an arrow stick, the mic and the key that hides or shows the keyboard. The bar stays at the bottom while the keyboard is hidden.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "三个玻璃胶囊：⌘、一排按键，以及方向摇杆、麦克风和收起或显示键盘的键。键盘收起时，按键栏留在屏幕底部。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Three pages of keys": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "三页按键"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Too large": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文件过大"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Trust & Save": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "信任并保存"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Trust this SSH host?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "信任此 SSH 主机？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try Demo Mode": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "进入演示模式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try again": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重试"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn On": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turns text too close to its background black or white, colors programs set too, so it reads; its color is lost, so errors and warnings may look alike. Box drawing keeps its colors. Off shows programs' colors as they are.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把与背景太接近的文字换成黑色或白色，包括程序设置的颜色，以便阅读；原来的颜色会丢失，错误、警告等可能看起来一样。框线字符保持原色。关闭后按程序的颜色原样显示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Two handles move the ends of the selection, and a menu has Copy, Paste and Select All.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "两个手柄调整选区的两端，菜单里有拷贝、粘贴和全选。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Type": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "类型"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Type a path and press Go, or tap a folder below to open it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "输入路径后按「前往」，或轻点下方的文件夹将其打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unsupported address. Enter an http:// or https:// address, like http://192.168.1.2:7297.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不支持的地址。请输入 http:// 或 https:// 地址，例如 http://192.168.1.2:7297。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Up": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上一级"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Up Arrow": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上方向键"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Update the details for this remote host.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "更新此远程主机的信息。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Upload progress": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上传进度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uploaded": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已上传"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uploaded, Not Pasted": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已上传，未粘贴"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uploading %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在上传 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uploading %lld files": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在上传 %lld 个文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use This Folder": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用此文件夹"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use This Folder: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用此文件夹：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use by Default": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设为默认"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Username": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用户名"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Username is required.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请输入用户名。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "版本"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version %@ (%@)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "版本 %@ (%@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version Info": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "版本信息"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Violet": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "紫色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Web and mail links in the output open with a tap, as do links a program marks with OSC 8. A link followed by Chinese ends where its address does.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "输出中的网页和邮件链接轻点即可打开，程序用 OSC 8 标记的链接也一样。链接后紧跟中文时，链接在地址结束处截止。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What you type is sent when the connection is back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连接恢复后会发送你输入的内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When a program needs input": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "程序需要输入时提醒"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When an agent such as Claude Code waits for you, a notification says so, while the app is open or soon after you leave it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code 等代理在等你操作时会发来通知，App 在前台或刚切到后台时都有效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Working": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "进行中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can't read this folder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你无权读取这个文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You logged in to %@ with a password. Installing this phone's SSH key on it connects without one.%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你已使用密码登录 %1$@。将本机的 SSH 公钥安装到该主机后，下次连接将无需输入密码。%2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're exploring a demo Mac. Nothing is connected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你正在体验一台演示 Mac，未连接任何服务器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're in demo mode. Add a host to run your own tabs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
